These certificates and this private key are public, test-only fixtures made
for the FerroStore TLS test suite: the key is published in this repository,
so anyone can impersonate a server that uses it. Never deploy any of them,
and never trust ca.pem or other-ca.pem outside the tests. They were made
once with OpenSSL 3.5 (the CA keys were discarded); the exact commands are
in the module comment at the top of crates/store/src/ferrostore/tests_tls.rs.
